%% Figure 4-2 — Request to verified outcome.
%% Message: every hop is authorized and recorded; context is assembled and
%% authorized before the bounded step runs; the model proposes, the platform
%% decides, and the effect is proven before the answer is returned.
%% No autonumber: the step numbers 1-16 competed with the eight numbered steps
%% in the table beneath the figure, and self-message labels sat under them.
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Run as Run Service
    participant Ctx as Context Service
    participant Agent as Agent Runtime
    participant Pol as Policy & Identity
    participant Appr as Approval Service
    participant Tool as Tool Gateway
    participant Sys as System of Record

    User->>Run: request + delegated grant
    Run->>Run: admit run, write RunManifest
    Run->>Ctx: assemble authorized context
    Ctx-->>Run: context manifest id
    Run->>Agent: bounded step (AgentStepRequest)
    Agent-->>Run: typed proposal (AgentStepResult)
    Note over Run,Pol: the model proposes, the platform decides
    Run->>Pol: authorize this action for this subject
    Pol-->>Run: grant, or refusal
    opt protected change
        Run->>Appr: approval request bound to the proposal
        Appr-->>Run: approval decision
    end
    Run->>Tool: invoke with logical effect key
    Tool->>Sys: commit effect
    Sys-->>Tool: receipt
    Tool-->>Run: effect record
    Run->>Run: evaluate acceptance criteria
    Run-->>User: verified outcome + evidence
